 배우게 했다. 어머니는 아들이 미전에 입선한 이듬해 별세했다.\n김기창은 등단 초기엔 호를 운포(雲圃)라고 했다. 1930년대 기사에선 ‘운포’로 나온다. 매년 미전에 입선하며 두각을 나타냈다. 1937년엔 동양화 ‘고담(古談)’으로 특선에 올랐다.","date":"2026-01-22T20:00:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2026/01/23/CHBT6DDSDJCE5GTXLCUO4HVBJQ/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"[인사] 국민대 외","partialText":"","date":"2026-01-22T15:42:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2026/01/23/ZHMIC6YR7JDTJMSHB3RRW7BK6E/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"[TV조선] 세기의 라이벌 특집","partialText":"","date":"2026-01-22T15:38:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2026/01/23/UGNEBE4JCBB4PKGJFN477574DQ/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"캣츠아이, 美 그래미 시상식 무대 꾸민다… 신인상 후보로 공연","partialText":"","date":"2026-01-22T06:31:13.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2026/01/22/IABZJR2C75DTFNNPEOY6PEFHRY/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"하이브 찾은 김 총리 “BTS 컴백, 또다시 세계 놀라게 할 것”","partialText":"","date":"2026-01-22T05:54:42.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/k-culture/2026/01/22/YJCXQNSFMFEY5G2JYUKBH25QQY/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일